  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ディアルガに使うと力がみなぎり姿が変わる光り輝く大きな珠。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "눈부시게 빛나는 큰 구슬. 디아루가에게 사용하면 힘이 넘쳐서 모습이 바뀐다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "光輝燦爛的大珠子。對帝牙盧卡使用後，能使之力量高漲並改變形態。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ce grand cristal brillant débordant de puissance permet à Dialga de changer de forme.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Wird dieser große, funkelnde Kristall auf Dialga angewendet, wird es von Kraft erfüllt und nimmt eine andere Form an.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gema brillante de gran tamaño que, cuando se usa con Dialga, lo imbuye de poder y le permite cambiar de forma.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Grande cristallo scintillante che, se usato su Dialga, lo riempie di energia e gli permette di cambiare forma.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "When used on Dialga, this large, glowing gem wells with power and allows the Pokémon to change form.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ディアルガに使うと力がみなぎり姿が変わる光り輝く大きな珠。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "光辉灿烂的大珠子。对帝牙卢卡使用后，能使之力量高涨并改变形态。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gema brillante de gran tamaño que, cuando se usa con Dialga, lo imbuye de poder y le permite cambiar de forma.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/24/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ディアルガに　持たせると力がみなぎり　姿が変わる光り輝く　大きな珠。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "눈부시게 빛나는 큰 구슬. 디아루가에게 지니게 하면 힘이 넘쳐서 모습이 바뀐다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "光輝燦爛的大珠子。讓帝牙盧卡攜帶的話，能使之力量高漲並改變形態。",
